1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:04,835
Every message you send lands with people
who take things in differently.

2
00:00:05,085 --> 00:00:06,202
Some want the number.

3
00:00:06,202 --> 00:00:07,532
Some want to see it move.

4
00:00:07,532 --> 00:00:10,012
Some want to click through it themselves.

5
00:00:10,262 --> 00:00:15,045
Seneca gives your agent the skills
to build the format each audience needs.

6
00:00:15,295 --> 00:00:18,693
It's all made with HTML,
CSS, and JavaScript,

7
00:00:18,693 --> 00:00:21,938
the language agents already speak best.

8
00:00:22,188 --> 00:00:25,407
So what you get is a file
that opens anywhere.

9
00:00:25,407 --> 00:00:28,996
A link, a PDF, a GIF,
or a video like this one.

10
00:00:29,246 --> 00:00:31,296
Meet every audience where they are.

11
00:00:31,296 --> 00:00:34,290
Seneca is open source,
and ready when you are.
